OL,3,GNEWSAProposed transport cuts could hit
OL,4,Adisabled pupils
OL,5,
OL,6,FYoung people with disabilities could be
OL,7,Fencouraged to use public buses under
OL,8,Fcouncil plans to save money.
OL,10,FDurham County Council is considering
OL,11,Ffive changes to transport for students
OL,12,Faged 16 and over as it tries to tackle
OL,13,Fcosts, which have risen sharply over
OL,14,Fthe last five years.
OL,16,FAn assessment made by the Reform UK-led
OL,17,Fauthority said proposals could have a
OL,18,F"potential disproportionate negative
OL,19,Fimpact" on disabled young people, with
OL,20,Fmore than 500 registered for post-16
OL,21,Fhome to school transport in the last
OL,22,Fyear.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,400,390,260,160,0,100
